== Mechanics ==
{{Main|Raffle of the Century}}
The Raffle Box has {{Green|3}} ongoing Raffles known as '''Speed Raffle''', '''Daily Raffle''' and '''The Big One''', the speed raffle rolls every 2 hours, the daily raffle every 24 hours and the big one at the end of the event.
<!-- === Earning Tickets ===
To enter each Raffle, the player needs to earn raffle tickets which can be earned through various methods, including being online, completing daily quests and eating cake slices.

==== Being Online ====
The player earns {{Green|1}} Raffle Ticket every 30 minutes being online, up to 12 hours, totaling {{Green|24}} Raffle Tickets per day.

