==== Cake Slices ====
{{Main|Cake Slice}}
Throughout the event, the player can obtain various Cake Slices through Daily Quests, Raffle Milestone and Compensation Rewards, there are {{Green|5}} Cake Slices with each matching one of the team colors, the player can give another player a cake slice to eat for both players to earn {{Green|1}} Raffle Ticket as well extra rewards including {{Coins}}, more Raffle Tickets, {{ID|Token of the Century}} and even a [[Century Cake]].

Each Player can eat up to {{Green|50}} Cake Slices per day.
outdated info:
Every 20 minutes, the player gains {{Green|+1}} Raffle Ticket and a message that reads {{Rmt|&6&lPLAYTIME! &eYou gained &b+1 Raffle Ticket&e!}}. The player does not need to be actively moving to obtain a ticket.
Every 20 minutes, the player has a {{Green|1%}} chance to get {{Green|+1 Raffle Ticket}} while gaining [[Skill]] XP or {{Bits}}, and a message that reads {{Rmt|&6&lACTIVE PLAYER! &eYou gained &b+1 Raffle Ticket&e!}}.

When hovering over a Raffle Ticket message, a box pops up over the chat that reads "Tickets are automatically entered into ALL Year 300 raffles. talk to Rezzus or check out the raffle box in the Hub or SkyBlock Menu!"

